 .../keyword-detector/ultrawork/gemini.ts      | 27 ++++++++++++++++++
 src/hooks/keyword-detector/ultrawork/gpt.ts   | 28 +++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 82 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

